abstract: >-
  An evidence-checked corpus through 2026-07-31 covering 34 physical-robot
  core studies, two measurement/context papers, 25 mechanisms, 424
  quantitative evidence rows (408 standard plus 16 supplemental, 162
  not reported), 88 atomic time rows, and 25 bounded synthesis claims.
